,"review_id":"U_0EdLj5VRn98KxtQId26A","date":"2019-05-22T02:42:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9360502362251282,"text_excerpt":"First time at this location and I had an enjoyable time. It's not quite as big as the one in Dania Beach or Atlanta but there are a lot of games to indulge. So, I came on their Thursday's unlimited wings and games night for $19.99. This is a huge bargain to me because you're getting the best of two desirable offerings in one package. It begins at 11:00am and ends at midnight. Some folks said they leave their ID or credit card to exit and come back later and apparently they hold them at the bar. I'll pass on that. You have the choice of bar-b-que wings or buffalo wings and let me tell you that the buffalo wings are ahhhhmazing!!! They kind of remind me of Anchor Bar's wings just with more ..."},{"business_id":"UmjITdXHhEF46ho6IhaGQg","review_id":"O3IRhAqBnhJOqjoDWLfYTw","date":"2018-11-13T22:57:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9258960485458374,"text_excerpt":"This was my first trip to Dave and Busters. I was watching a friend's children while she and her husband were out of town. Dropped the daughter off at a birthday party and took the son to eat and play downtown. I'm not quite sure why they've gotten such bad reviews in the past? From the time we walked in till the time we left, we had a great experience for the price! Got there around 6:30, bought two cards to play with, and then got a table to sit down to eat. While my friends son went to play his games, I waited for our food to arrive. The atmosphere was lit. Very lively. Nice and clean too. I wasn't drinking but they did have happy hour going on till 7 with $3,$4 and $5 drinks. It didn'..."},{"business_id":"UmjITdXHhEF46ho6IhaGQg","review_id":"cssSt7HV6IsY2DdpIC9_PA","date":"2021-08-20T18:55:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9244484901428223,"text_excerpt":"Recently went here with my friends and we had an awesome time. We were truly acting like kids in there. The staff was very helpful when we didn't know how to operate a game. We called them more than once and they did not complain at all. I'm not a big gamer but even I had to admit that I had fun playing the dance game and air hockey (some games never get old). After we wore ourselves out playing games we went to the bar. The drinks were good and the bartender was extra nice. This is a place for all ages. It's located in the CBD so be prepared to pay for parking but plenty of parking is available. They have an entire garage."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"UmjITdXHhEF46ho6IhaGQg","photo_id":"O_ZXgpMy6gH6wX637mIrrg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/O_ZXgpMy6gH6wX637mIrrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.835691511631012},{"business_id":"UmjITdXHhEF46ho6IhaGQg","photo_id":"cPCbSLhKQlOMJgrPdYmGWA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cPCbSLhKQlOMJgrPdYmGWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8277921676635742},{"business_id":"UmjITdXHhEF46ho6IhaGQg","photo_id":"TPcKLSmK8pab-v02m91LBg","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/TPcKLSmK8pab-v02m91LBg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8132390975952148},{"business_id":"UmjITdXHhEF46ho6IhaGQg","photo_id":"j-2460kOIgrEu8lUHff-0w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/j-2460kOIgrEu8lUHff-0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.773916482925415},{"business_id":"UmjITdXHhEF46ho6IhaGQg","photo_id":"3EVKupJIla4Td_veGAmEyA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/3EVKupJIla4Td_veGAmEyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7060537338256836}]},"notebook_case":null}
